{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_070430","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“Reptile”就是“爬虫类”的意思。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"大脑中负责维持生命和反射的部分，是人类在很久以前还是<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>的阶段发展出来的。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"曾经是<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>……？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"说的是进化阶段。这是一个叫Paul MacLean的神经生化学家提出的理论。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>脑相当于脑干和大脑基底核。不过实际的Reptile Pod还覆盖了小脑的功能。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=爬虫类,REPTILE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"简单说，就是大脑深处的部分。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这个名字是Strangelove起的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""}]}